              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B"
            },
            "name": "Seeded Prompt Intent Identifier"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 6704,
            "y": 5428
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1784123940679"
          },
          "id": "1784123790082",
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_SEEDED_PROMPT_INTENT_IDENTIFIER",
          "type": "LLM",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1784123790082_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an input classifier and parameter extractor for Supplier Offers Assistant.\n\nuserMessage = {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nClassify the userMessage into one of the seeded prompt types below and extract the duration as `numberOfDays`.\n\nExact matching rules:\n- The userMessage must match one of the templates exactly.\n- Match the full string from beginning to end.\n- Do not infer intent.\n- Do not trim, lowercase, normalize, or correct the userMessage.\n- Reject typos, synonyms, extra words, missing words, reordered words, extra punctuation, different casing, or extra spaces.\n- Only the duration value and unit may vary where `[duration]` is shown.\n- A valid duration must be exactly: `<number> <unit>`\n- Valid units are: `day`, `days`, `month`, `months`, `year`, `years`\n\nSeeded prompt templates:\n\n1. Exact match:\nShow draft offers having invoices no longer eligible for early payment and discard them\nSeededPromptType: earlyPayment\nnumberOfDays: 0\n\n2. Exact pattern:\nShow draft offers unreviewed for more than [duration] and estimated loss of benefit\nSeededPromptType: draftOfferUnreviewed\n\n3. Exact pattern:\nShow communicated offers that are expiring in the next [duration] and estimated loss of benefit\nSeededPromptType: communicatedOffer\n\n4. Exact pattern:\nShow communicated offers in last [duration] and acceptance rate by supplier\nSeededPromptType: acceptanceRate\n\nUse these full-string patterns only:\n\n1. ^Show draft offers having invoices no longer eligible for early payment and discard them$\n\n2. ^Show draft offers unreviewed for more than ([0-9]+) (day|days|month|months|year|years) and estimated loss of benefit$\n\n3. ^Show communicated offers that are expiring in the next ([0-9]+) (day|days|month|months|year|years) and estimated loss of benefit$\n\n4. ^Show communicated offers in last ([0-9]+) (day|days|month|months|year|years) and acceptance rate by supplier$\n\nDuration conversion rules:\n- 1 day = 1 day\n- 1 month = 30 days\n- 1 year = 365 days\n\nExamples:\n- 3 days -> 3\n- 2 months -> 60\n- 3 years -> 1095\n\nIf the userMessage does not exactly match one of the allowed templates or patterns, set `SeededPromptType` to `NA` and `numberOfDays` to `0`.\n\nReturn only valid JSON. Do not include markdown, explanations, or additional fields.\n\nUse exactly this JSON structure:\n\n{\n  \"SeededPromptType\": \"<seeded prompt type or NA>\",\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"numberOfDays\": <derived number of days or 0>\n  }\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"SeededPromptType\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"earlyPayment\",\n            \"draftOfferUnreviewed\",\n            \"communicatedOffer\",\n            \"acceptanceRate\",\n            \"NA\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"parameters\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"numberOfDays\": {\n              \"type\": \"integer\",\n              \"minimum\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"numberOfDays\"\n          ],\n          \"additionalProperties\": false\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"SeededPromptType\",\n        \"parameters\"\n      ],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"
        },
        {
